would rebuild the join from `commandPolicies`, the doctor details and the projection.\\n59: - **Public fields** (`ADV/schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts`, `ADV/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts`): `publicRecommendation` copies `kind` and, for a row found in `COMMAND_ROWS`, sets `command`, `policy` and `ownerSkillId`. `enrichCompiledRoutes` adds the policy of an attached command and reads the already-offered set from the `command` fields instead of from bridge keywords.\\n60: - **Brief head** (`ADV/lib/render.ts`): a recommendation with a command renders `use <owner> → <command> (<policy>)`, where the owner is `ownerSkillId` or, for a hub with an attached comm...\n  Line 21: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794527726306,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d2300448001LyiuFlBIAj2udh\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d22fe3c6001aX7cOmCwYKJW8C\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_22104401e6e047b09cc910df\",\"tool\":\"shell\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git -c core.fsmonitor=false status --porcelain | head -40 && echo \\\"---\\\" && ls .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests | head -60\"},\"output\":\" M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/index.mjs\\n M .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/tests/bundle.test.mjs\\n M .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/ci-router-vocabulary-reach.cjs\\n M .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/tests/ci-router-vocabulary-reach.test.cjs\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/projection.ts\\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/