icy or owner, and the hook brief prints raw command ids such as command-speckit-save. This phase adds the four fields, prints the command and its policy in the brief head for every family, states the degraded-path contract and retires the allow-list and the hand-authored bridge leftovers.\\\"\\n4: trigger_phrases:\\n5:   - \\\"recommendation contract and brief\\\"\\n6:   - \\\"phase 5 recommendation contract and brief\\\"\\n7: importance_tier: \\\"normal\\\"\\n8: contextType: \\\"general\\\"\\n9: ---\\n10: <!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core | v2.4 -->\\n11: # Feature Specification: Phase 5: recommendation-contract-and-brief\\n12: \\n13: <!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\\n14: ---\\n15: \\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\\n17: ## 1. METADATA\\n18: \\n19: | Field | Value |\\n20: |-------|-------|\\n21: | **Level** | 2 |\\n22: | **Priority** | P1 |\\n23: | **Status** | Draft |\\n24: | **Created** | 2026-11-12 |\\n25: | **Branch** | `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research` |\\n26: | **Parent Spec** | ../spec.md |\\n27: | **Phase** | 5 of 7 |\\n28: | **Predecessor** | 004-command-meaning-matching |\\n29: | **Success...\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/scratch/logs/w5-T021.out:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1794527695371,\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22\",\"part\":{\"partID\":\"prt_1d22f8ff7001lrTs712F6z9tZM\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_e2dd11594ffe4d32Avi4cOny22\",\"messageID\":\"msg_1d22f823a001r68BB6ucSeVKRB\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"id\":\"call_482074cf44dd443f8900b78d\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/tasks.md\",\"limit\":120},\"output\":\"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeest