{"type":"text","timestamp":1794528267338,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0be9ffeMCJ7YmLC6El56o","part":{"id":"prt_1d2383a55002pHncZ4nMBOCLUV","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb0be9ffeMCJ7YmLC6El56o","messageID":"msg_1d238273c001Tqg8BWLy1dTloD","type":"text","text":"T027 complete.\n\n## Files changed\n\n- **Modified** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs`\n  - Removed `ALLOW_LIST_PATH`\n  - Removed `allowListEntries()`\n  - Removed the `allowListEntries()` read in `main`\n  - Removed the `allowListCommands` drop rule, so inventory is `metadata + doctor`\n  - Removed the `allowList` count, `commandMetadata` is now `metadata.length`\n  - Removed the allow-list references from comments\n- **Deleted** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json`\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n$ rg -n \"allow-list|allowList\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\nrg exit=1\n\n$ test ! -e .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json\ntest exit=0\n```\n\n`rg` exit 1 means no matches. Additionally `node --check` on the deriver exits 0. The task said not to run `D`, so I did not run it.\n\n`git status --porcelain` (read-only) for the two paths:\n\n```\n D .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/allow-list.json\n M .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs\n```\n\n## Could not do / out-of-scope consequence\n\n`.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-bridges-drift-guard.vitest.ts` still reads `allow-list.json` (constant at line 114, `allowListEntries()` at lines 234-252). That test will fail with ENOENT after this deletion. No task in `tasks.md` names it, so I left it untouched. The generated `command-bridges.generated.json` also keeps its `allowList` count and four allow-list-sourced entries until T034 regenerates it, which matches the task sequencing.\n\nI did not tick the T027 checkbox.","time":{"start":1794528262741,"end":1794528267338}}}
